{"ref":"BDB, שֶׁ֫טֶף","hw":"שֶׁ֫טֶף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֫טֶף</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֫צֶף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:8\" href=\"/Nahum.1.8\">Na 1:8</a></sup> <strong>flood</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֫טֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:8\" href=\"/Nahum.1.8\">Na 1:8</a> + 3 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.4\">Pr 27:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:6\" href=\"/Psalms.32.6\">ψ 32:6</a>;—<em>flood</em>, fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s judgment, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ עֹבֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:8\" href=\"/Nahum.1.8\">Na 1:8</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:26\" href=\"/Daniel.9.26\">Dn 9:26</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְרֹעוֹת הַשּׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:22\" href=\"/Daniel.11.22\">11:22</a> (cf. Dr); of calamity, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ מַיִם רַבִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:6\" href=\"/Psalms.32.6\">ψ 32:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ אָף</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.4\">Pr 27:4</a> <em>a flood of anger;</em> so <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁצֶף קֶצֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.8\">Is 54:8</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">צ</span> for ט bef. foll. צ Ew Di; > Du Che Marti del. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> as dittogr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁטֶף</span> lit. of rainflood, <a data-ref=\"Job 38:25\" href=\"/Job.38.25\">Jb 38:25</a>.","next":"BDB, שׁטר","prev":"BDB, שָׁטַף"}